From f47c166bbfd682f0f88f33648864979be16a032a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Goose contributors <goose@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 02:27:46 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Provide runtime hooks and reentrant native callbacks

Provide native libraries with versioned abort, shutdown and callback hooks.
Publish live stack tops for reentrant calls and expose eligible exports by
name and signature, restricting callbacks to the program thread and exports
that do not access mutable globals.
